# ─────────────────────────────  SECRETS — NEVER COMMIT  ─────────────────────────────
# The Firebase Admin SDK key gives full, rule-bypassing access to Firestore,
# Storage and Auth. It must only ever live on the server / in a host's env vars.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.env
*.pem
*.key

# ─────────────────────────────  DEPENDENCIES  ─────────────────────────────
node_modules/
backend/node_modules/

# ─────────────────────────────  BUILD OUTPUT  ─────────────────────────────
dist/
build/
.vercel/
.cache/

# ─────────────────────────────  HEAVY WORKING FILES  ─────────────────────────────
# Blender sources and derived backups are not needed by the deployed site.
# Keep them on your machine (or in Drive), not in the repo.
*.blend
*.blend1

# ─────────────────────────────  OS / EDITOR  ─────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
npm-debug.log*